		<defName>CGF1_MWP_Type84_Pistol_</defName>
		<label>Type 84 Pistol</label>
		<description>Caliber: 7.62x17mm Rimless. 6-round detachable mag. Semi-Automatic.
	
The Type 84 is a Chinese ultra-compact pistol designed in the 1980s. Highly concealable and small, it was made to use an ultra low velocity variant of the 7.62x17mm Rimless round that was meant to minimize penetration, primarily for use in a setting like an airplane where overpenetration would be a risk.</description>
